iti | trīṇyantarbahirubhayarūpāṇi lakṣyāṇi lakṣaṇīyāni yatra | 
nirāvaraṇarūpatvāt

	(")khamanantaṃ tu janmākhyaṃ |(") (7-27)

iti vakṣyamāṇānāṃ janma(-)nābhi(-)hṛd(-)bindu(-)nādarūpāṇāṃ vyomnāṃ 
pañcakaṃ vidyate yatra(,)

