ye pāśāstaiḥ saṃyuktam | icchādinā śaktitrayeṇa 
samyaganvitameṣaṇīyādiviṣaye pravartamānam | soma(-)sūrya(-)
vahnirūpadhāmatrayapathaiḥ savyāpasavyapavanairmadhyamapavanena 
