kuhūśaṅkhinībhiśca yuktatvād daśa nāḍayaḥ panthāno yeṣāṃ 
prāṇāpānasamānodānavyānanāgakūrmakṛkaradevadattadhanañjayā(-)
khyāstaiḥ ā samantād vṛtamotaprotam | 
digdaśakāvasthitanāḍidaśakaprapañcabhūtābhirdvāsaptatyā 
