	suśuddhasphaṭikaprakhyāṃ kundenduśaśinirmalām	|

	caturbhujāṃ trinetrāṃ ca vaktraikena vibhūṣitām || 10-18 ||

	sitāmbaradharāṃ devīṃ sitahāravibhūṣitām |

