amṛtamiti uktavakṣyamāṇaparāmṛtavyāptikam(,) kalāsu ādivisargāntāsu 
ṣoḍaśasu sthitaṃ tatsaṃbhinnam(,) tābhiḥ sakāraśliṣṭābhiḥ kalābhiḥ(,) 
