likhedityarthaḥ | kalaśabāhye candrasūryau ṭhaḍau purandarapure caturaśre 
vajralāñchitasaṃniveśena sthitau kuryāt | etat śāntau(,) 
pūrvopadravanāśinī(,) punarasyaivopari kṣīrapūrṇamamṛtaṃ sravantaṃ 
kalaśaṃ dhyāyediti puṣṭiḥ ||


