cakārādamṛtīkṛtaḥ ||

īdṛśasya ca sādhyasya 


	(..........)ṇa tasya bhayadāḥ kvacit |


	bhavanti yoginībhūtayakṣarākṣasahiṃsakāḥ || 17-25 ||

