	ākrāntaṃ ca tathādyantaṃ garbhasthaṃ sarvatovṛtam |

	tathā yuktividarbhaṃ ca vidarbhagrathitaṃ tathā || 18-11 ||

	ityekādaśadhā mantrā niyuktāḥ siddhidāḥ smṛtāḥ |


	ādyantayormantranyāsaḥ saṃpuṭavat |

