	(")abhidheyaṃ bhavetpūrvaṃ tato mantraḥ sakṛd bhavet |

	vidarbhitaṃ(.......................................................................)	||(")

iti | madhyasthasya nāmno mantro yadi veṣṭanayā nyasta ākrāntam |

