	kaṭakādyairmahāhāraiḥ puṣpasragdāmabhūṣitaḥ	|

	mūrtipairdhūpavāhaiśca arghavāhaistathaiva ca || 18-60 ||

	sarvasaṃbhārasaṃyukto hyadhivāsanapūrvakam |

	kumbhāstravārdhanīmiṣṭvā kṛtakṣetraparigrahaḥ || 18-61 ||

	paścāddevi rajaḥpātaṃ vidadhyād daiśikottamaḥ	|


śuciriti śuddhavittacittaśarīraḥ | dakṣaḥ pūjādāvudyuktaḥ(,) 
anuṣṭhitanityakarmatvādeva candanādicarcitaḥ | dhautapautikā 
mahāprakāśaparītatāśayāt | uṣṇīṣaḥ śirasi paṭṭādibandhaḥ |
aṅguliraṅgulīyakam | mūrtipairiti 
pṛthivyādimūrtyaṣṭakādhiṣṭhātṛśarvādimūrtīśvararūpairācāryānt
arairanugataḥ(,) evaṃ cāṣṭamūrtimaheśvaraikarūpa ityarthaḥ | 
arghavāhairityādau yukta iti yojyam | sarvasaṃbhāro'dhivāsocito 
dravyasamūhaḥ(,) adhivāsanaṃ śivayāgaucityena dravyādeḥ saṃskāraḥ
śrīsvacchandādiṣṭanītyā | kumbhayāgaḥ sarvavidhisaṃpūraṇādyarthaḥ 
| astrayāgaśca vighnaśamanāya | kṛtakṣetraparigraho 
gṛhītayāgocitasthānaviśeṣaḥ(,) rajaḥpātamiti proktakrameṇa
racitamaṇḍalaviśeṣam ||

evamatramaṇḍale 


